<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Linux on cdk's blog</title><link>http://localhost:1313/categories/linux/</link><description>Recent content in Linux on cdk's blog</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 13 Dec 2025 23:41:21 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="http://localhost:1313/categories/linux/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Linux基础命令</title><link>http://localhost:1313/computernotes/linux%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4/</link><pubDate>Sat, 13 Dec 2025 23:41:21 +0800</pubDate><guid>http://localhost:1313/computernotes/linux%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="linux基础命令">Linux基础命令
&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#linux%e5%9f%ba%e7%a1%80%e5%91%bd%e4%bb%a4">&lt;/a>
&lt;/h1>&lt;h2 id="文件目录操作">文件目录操作
&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#%e6%96%87%e4%bb%b6%e7%9b%ae%e5%bd%95%e6%93%8d%e4%bd%9c">&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;h3 id="ls-列出命令">ls 列出命令
&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#ls-%e5%88%97%e5%87%ba%e5%91%bd%e4%bb%a4">&lt;/a>
&lt;/h3>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-1">&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-1">1&lt;/a>
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-2">&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-2">2&lt;/a>
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-3">&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-3">3&lt;/a>
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-4">&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-4">4&lt;/a>
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># list 列出当前目录下所有的文件&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">ls
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 列出每个文件的属性 &lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">ls -l&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>


&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-1">&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-1">1&lt;/a>
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-1-2">&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-1-2">2&lt;/a>
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">-rw-r--r-- 1 xxx xxx 5795 Dec 13 23:53 README.md
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">drwxr-xr-x 2 xxx xxx 4096 Dec 13 23:53 appendix-optimization&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>

&lt;ol>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>第一列是权限相关: 第一个字母是d表示目录-表示普通文件之后是权限rwx(Read Write eXecute)&lt;/p>
&lt;/li>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>第一组是所有者权限 第二组是同一个group下用户的权限 第三组是group外成员的权限&lt;/p>
&lt;/li>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>第三列是所有者 第四列是group名 第五列是文件大小 之后是修改时间&lt;/p>
&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>

&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-2-1">&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-2-1">1&lt;/a>
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-2-2">&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-2-2">2&lt;/a>
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-2-3">&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-2-3">3&lt;/a>
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-2-4">&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-2-4">4&lt;/a>
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 显示目录下的隐藏文件&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">ls -a
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 列出文件属性包含隐藏文件&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">ls -la&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>


 &lt;blockquote>
 &lt;p>一般终端中都定义ll命令, 相当于是ls -l&lt;/p>

&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-3-1">&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-3-1">1&lt;/a>
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-3-2">&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-3-2">2&lt;/a>
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># ls -l 的缩写&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">ll&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>
 &lt;/blockquote>
&lt;h3 id="cd-进入目录命令">cd 进入目录命令
&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#cd-%e8%bf%9b%e5%85%a5%e7%9b%ae%e5%bd%95%e5%91%bd%e4%bb%a4">&lt;/a>
&lt;/h3>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-4-1">&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-4-1"> 1&lt;/a>
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-4-2">&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-4-2"> 2&lt;/a>
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-4-3">&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-4-3"> 3&lt;/a>
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-4-4">&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-4-4"> 4&lt;/a>
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-4-5">&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-4-5"> 5&lt;/a>
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-4-6">&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-4-6"> 6&lt;/a>
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-4-7">&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-4-7"> 7&lt;/a>
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-4-8">&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-4-8"> 8&lt;/a>
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-4-9">&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-4-9"> 9&lt;/a>
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-4-10">&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-4-10">10&lt;/a>
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"># 进入目录
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">cd dictionary_name
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"># 进入上一层目录
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">cd ..
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"># 进入当前目录
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">cd .
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"># 进入上上层目录
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">cd ../..
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"># 回到刚刚的目录
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">cd -&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>

&lt;h3 id="pwd-print-working-directory命令">pwd Print working directory命令
&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#pwd-print-working-directory%e5%91%bd%e4%bb%a4">&lt;/a>
